WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.916
<b>In the previous verse, Lord Krishna stated</b>

2
00:00:32.916 --> 00:00:39.416
<b>that to acquire spiritual knowledge, </b>
<b>we must approach a wise guru,</b>

3
00:00:39.416 --> 00:00:43.791
<b>humbly ask them questions, and serve them.</b>

4
00:00:43.791 --> 00:00:48.916
<b>Only a learned guru who knows the </b>
<b>truth can impart this knowledge to us</b>

5
00:00:48.916 --> 00:00:54.541
<b>because only they have known</b>
<b>and experienced the truth.</b>

6
00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.416
<b>Now, in this verse, Lord Krishna is explaining</b>

7
00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:05.166
<b>the powerful impact that receiving knowledge from </b>
<b>a self-realized guru can have on a disciple's life.</b>

8
00:01:09.916 --> 00:01:13.916
<b>Regarding knowing the truth of spiritual</b>
<b>knowledge from a true guru,</b>

9
00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:16.375
<b>Lord Krishna says in this verse,</b>

10
00:01:16.375 --> 00:01:17.333
<b>"Arjuna,</b>

11
00:01:17.333 --> 00:01:22.500
<b>after gaining this knowledge of the truth,</b>
<b>you will never again fall into delusion.</b>

12
00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.791
<b>By attaining this knowledge, you will understand</b>

13
00:01:24.791 --> 00:01:30.666
<b>that all living beings are part of Me, </b>
<b>and they are all united in Me."</b>

14
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:33.916
<b>In other words, as soon as Arjuna knows </b>
<b>the truth of spiritual knowledge,</b>

15
00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:37.291
<b>he will be able to see the spiritual nature </b>
<b>of everyliving being </b>

16
00:01:37.291 --> 00:01:43.250
<b>and understand that all those souls are</b>
<b>connected to the Supreme Soul, Lord Krishna.</b>

17
00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.708
<b>Here, for the first time,</b>

18
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:51.166
<b>the relationship between us or other individual</b>
<b>souls and Lord Krishna Himself is clarified.</b>

19
00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:58.541
<b>This knowledge is not only important for us </b>
<b>but also invaluable for Arjuna at this moment.</b>

20
00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:01.875
<b>Lord Krishna is indirectly saying,</b>

21
00:02:01.875 --> 00:02:07.833
<b>"Arjuna, why lament the death of </b>
<b>your own relatives on the battlefield,</b>

22
00:02:07.833 --> 00:02:10.333
<b>for they are all part of Me."</b>

23
00:02:10.333 --> 00:02:15.708
<b>In this verse, two unprecedented effects of </b>
<b>attaining spiritual knowledge are described:</b>

24
00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:16.750
<b>First -</b>

25
00:02:16.750 --> 00:02:19.250
<b>freedom from delusion and illusion: </b>

26
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:24.958
<b>When you understand the truth of the soul </b>
<b>and recognize the spiritual nature of all,</b>

27
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:31.375
<b>the attachments of this world's temporary and</b>
<b>material relationships can no longer entangle us.</b>

28
00:02:31.375 --> 00:02:32.333
<b>Second -</b>

29
00:02:32.333 --> 00:02:34.875
<b>understanding all as part of Krishna: </b>

30
00:02:34.875 --> 00:02:42.291
<b>One who attains true spiritual knowledge realizes </b>
<b>that all living beings are parts of Krishna.</b>

31
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:47.833
<b>It is Maya and delusion that give us the illusion </b>
<b>of being separate from Krishna.</b>

32
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:52.083
<b>And in this illusion, we forget our true identity.</b>

33
00:02:52.083 --> 00:02:53.000
<b>But</b>

34
00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:58.000
<b>when we see the soul in everyone, we will </b>
<b>also begin to see Krishna in everyone,</b>

35
00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:02.250
<b>and then this illusion of being separate</b>
<b>from Krishna will shatter.</b>

36
00:03:02.250 --> 00:03:05.416
<b>And if we are indeed a part of Krishna,</b>

37
00:03:05.416 --> 00:03:10.333
<b>then the real purpose of this life is to </b>
<b>engage in His service, isn't it?</b>

38
00:03:10.333 --> 00:03:17.541
<b>Ignorance shows us the different forms of </b>
<b>all beings - humans, animals, demigods, etc.,</b>

39
00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:25.000
<b>while knowledge teaches us that our eternal </b>
<b>form and that of all beings is as a soul.</b>

40
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:29.208
<b>The gist is that no matter how </b>
<b>far a person has strayed,</b>

41
00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:35.625
<b>one who has found this spiritual truth will </b>
<b>immediately know the way home,</b>

42
00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:39.500
<b>and this path leads only to Krishna.</b>

43
00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.458
<b>Going to Him is like returning home.</b>

44
00:03:48.208 --> 00:03:52.750
<b>After knowing the truth of spiritual knowledge,</b>

45
00:03:52.750 --> 00:04:00.125
<b>no delusion or illusion can lead you astray.</b>

46
00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:03.375
<b>Understand this with an example...</b>

47
00:04:03.375 --> 00:04:05.000
<b>Imagine</b>

48
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.541
<b>you have gone to visit a new metropolis.</b>

49
00:04:09.541 --> 00:04:14.791
<b>If you don't have complete knowledge </b>
<b>of all the routes in that city, </b>

50
00:04:14.791 --> 00:04:17.083
<b>there is a possibility,</b>

51
00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:22.416
<b>you might get lost or take a wrong turn.</b>

52
00:04:22.416 --> 00:04:25.083
<b>Not only will there be difficulties in sightseeing,</b>

53
00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:31.250
<b>but there will also be a delay </b>
<b>in reaching your residence.</b>

54
00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.500
<b>But</b>

55
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.541
<b>there,</b>

56
00:04:33.541 --> 00:04:38.750
<b>if you have a map or plan of</b>
<b>that city in your hand,</b>

57
00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:45.333
<b>then you will be able to roam around there</b>
<b>with great ease without any mistakes or delays,</b>

58
00:04:45.333 --> 00:04:50.666
<b>and you will also return to your residence in time.</b>

59
00:04:50.666 --> 00:04:54.541
<b>Spiritual knowledge is just that.</b>

60
00:04:54.541 --> 00:04:58.875
<b>A plan of this life, A map.</b>

61
00:04:58.875 --> 00:05:00.500
<b>Suppose</b>

62
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:04.416
<b>you are about to make a big decision in life.</b>

63
00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:07.458
<b>It could be related to professional advancement</b>

64
00:05:07.458 --> 00:05:15.291
<b>or even an important matter </b>
<b>like choosing a life partner.</b>

65
00:05:15.291 --> 00:05:19.875
<b>If you don't have spiritual clarity,</b>

66
00:05:19.875 --> 00:05:26.750
<b>you will start making decisions based only on</b>
<b>material attractions and momentary gains,</b>

67
00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:31.750
<b>which can lead to great suffering</b>
<b>and stress in the future.</b>

68
00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:32.791
<b>But</b>

69
00:05:32.791 --> 00:05:36.291
<b>if you have spiritual clarity,</b>

70
00:05:36.291 --> 00:05:40.083
<b>you will rise above momentary attractions</b>

71
00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:45.541
<b>and make decisions that </b>
<b>align with proper life values</b>

72
00:05:45.541 --> 00:05:48.708
<b>and will be helpful in your life's purpose.</b>

73
00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:51.916
<b>This is the basis of stress-free stability.</b>

74
00:05:51.916 --> 00:05:55.291
<b>This brings lasting progress.</b>

75
00:05:55.291 --> 00:05:58.791
<b>This map of spiritual knowledge is priceless,</b>

76
00:05:58.791 --> 00:06:04.625
<b>both in this life and beyond.</b>

77
00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:10.000
<b>Understand this map and always keep it with you.</b>

78
00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:18.250
<b>All living beings are indeed souls.</b>

79
00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:23.708
<b>They are all indeed My parts.</b>

80
00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:28.958
<b>In social and family contexts, this truth</b>

81
00:06:28.958 --> 00:06:32.458
<b>will completely change your perspective.</b>

82
00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:34.083
<b>Think about it,</b>

83
00:06:34.083 --> 00:06:39.125
<b>if you are abroad and meet a fellow countryman,</b>

84
00:06:39.125 --> 00:06:44.375
<b>you naturally feel affection towards them.</b>

85
00:06:44.375 --> 00:06:45.333
<b>Whereas</b>

86
00:06:45.333 --> 00:06:48.208
<b>while touring in your own country,</b>

87
00:06:48.208 --> 00:06:54.375
<b>if you meet someone from your city </b>
<b>or neighborhood, you feel joy.</b>

88
00:06:54.375 --> 00:07:01.500
<b>A natural affection arises towards</b>
<b>those living close to one's residence.</b>

89
00:07:01.500 --> 00:07:03.583
<b>Now imagine</b>

90
00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:11.041
<b>if the residence of every creature, every living </b>
<b>being, every human being was not only close</b>

91
00:07:11.041 --> 00:07:14.583
<b>but the same,</b>

92
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:19.500
<b>would affection for them not arise on its own?</b>

93
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.333
<b>This is the truth, isn't it?</b>

94
00:07:22.333 --> 00:07:26.750
<b>All souls are My parts,</b>

95
00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.166
<b>everyone's residence is within Me,</b>

96
00:07:30.166 --> 00:07:36.208
<b>so how can there be discrimination or discord?</b>

97
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:40.833
<b>All that is needed is to accept this truth,</b>

98
00:07:40.833 --> 00:07:48.750
<b>and then see how sweet your social and </b>
<b>family relationships will become.</b>

99
00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:51.666
<b>Know the spiritual nature of all.</b>

100
00:07:51.666 --> 00:07:57.166
<b>And try to resolve mutual differences with love.</b>

101
00:07:57.166 --> 00:08:03.541
<b>You will gradually realize that everyone </b>
<b>is fundamentally the same;</b>

102
00:08:03.541 --> 00:08:07.041
<b>everyone needs love.</b>

103
00:08:07.041 --> 00:08:09.583
<b>And one who has understood this </b>

104
00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:13.791
<b>will not only lead a joyful life themselves</b>

105
00:08:13.791 --> 00:08:20.833
<b>but will also have a positive impact</b>
<b>on the lives of many others.</b>

106
00:08:20.833 --> 00:08:23.041
<b>Remember this.</b>

107
00:08:27.666 --> 00:08:36.458
<b>Try looking at your professional organization</b>
<b> from this perspective once.</b>

108
00:08:36.458 --> 00:08:40.375
<b>All colleagues are part of this organization;</b>

109
00:08:40.375 --> 00:08:46.458
<b>everyone's goal is the same, isn't it? </b>
<b>The progress of this organization.</b>

110
00:08:46.458 --> 00:08:54.375
<b>So if everyone is part of this one goal, </b>
<b>then why jealousy?</b>

111
00:08:54.375 --> 00:08:58.916
<b>Why not lend a hand in each other's progress,</b>

112
00:08:58.916 --> 00:09:03.958
<b>because ultimately everyone's </b>
<b>individual progress</b>

113
00:09:03.958 --> 00:09:07.000
<b>will lead to the advancement of the organization.</b>

114
00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:12.666
<b>Try adopting this perspective in </b>
<b>a professional setting once.</b>

115
00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:18.625
<b>A new colleague joins your </b>
<b>department or organization.</b>

116
00:09:18.625 --> 00:09:22.833
<b>If your objective is the progress </b>
<b>of the organization,</b>

117
00:09:22.833 --> 00:09:30.041
<b>then it's such a natural thought that </b>
<b>you should assist new colleagues.</b>

118
00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:34.083
<b>So that their progress can be</b>
<b>helpful for the organization.</b>

119
00:09:34.083 --> 00:09:39.208
<b>If you are a senior executive appointed </b>
<b>to a leadership position,</b>

120
00:09:39.208 --> 00:09:44.250
<b>this perspective will make you</b>
<b>grateful towards everyone.</b>

121
00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:47.750
<b>It will make you empathetic towards them.</b>

122
00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.875
<b>These are just a few examples.</b>

123
00:09:50.875 --> 00:09:54.375
<b>Considering colleagues in a professional setting</b>

124
00:09:54.375 --> 00:10:00.250
<b>as fellow travelers heading towards</b>
<b>the same destination.</b>

125
00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:03.166
<b>This is a spiritual way of thinking.</b>

126
00:10:03.166 --> 00:10:08.666
<b>And this thinking will not only give </b>
<b>you stability and peace</b>

127
00:10:08.666 --> 00:10:14.375
<b>But make your professional relationships sweeter</b>

128
00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:18.750
<b>and will also assist in your personal progress.</b>

129
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.083
<b>Reflect upon this.</b>

